#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_28)
#: ui.py:132
msgid ""
"<qt>PostScript Printer Description (PPD) files can often be found on the "
"driver disk that comes with the printer. For PostScript printers they are "
"often part of the Windows<sup>®</sup> driver.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>PostScript-Druckerbeschrieven (PPD-Dateien) gifft dat faken op de Schiev "
"mit Drievers, de mit den Drucker utlevert warrt. Bi PostScript-Druckers sünd "
"se faken Deel vun den Windows<sup>®</sup>-Driever.</qt>"

